; AcpHal.def — ERA (Xbox One) audio-DSP-heap import lib (phase 5).
; The ACP is the console's audio DSP; desktop has no equivalent heap,
; so the layer answers these with explicit E_NOTIMPL stubs (logged) —
; see docs/ERA-GDK-MAPPING.md. Ordinals are the Xbox One shim-DLL
; AcpHal.dll ordinals: 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 8, 9, 10. (An earlier phase 5
; note claimed AcpHalAllocateShapeContexts was ordinal 0 and could not
; be expressed in a .def — that was wrong; its Xbox One shim-DLL
; ordinal is 1.) Signatures are XDK-gated; the stubs log their first
; four raw args.
LIBRARY AcpHal
EXPORTS
    AcpHalAllocateShapeContexts @1
    AcpHalCreate @2
    AcpHalReleaseShapeContexts @3
    ApuAlloc @4
    ApuCreateHeap @5
    ApuFree @6
    ApuIsVirtualAddressValid @8
    ApuMapApuAddress @9
    ApuMapVirtualAddress @10
